      <title>怀孕早期使用扑热息痛与卵巢和睾丸变小有关</title>
      <link>https://www.newscientist.com/article/2588178-common-painkiller-use-in-early-pregnancy-linked-to-smaller-ovaries-and-testes/?utm_campaign=RSS|NSNS&amp;utm_content=home&amp;utm_medium=RSS&amp;utm_source=NSNS</link>
      <description><![CDATA[怀孕期间服用止痛药扑热息痛（对乙酰氨基酚）与女婴和男婴的卵巢和睾丸变小有关，但这并不意味着它直接导致这些情况或影响生育能力]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.newscientist.com/article/2588178-common-painkiller-use-in-early-pregnancy-linked-to-smaller-ovaries-and-testes/?utm_campaign=RSS|NSNS&amp;utm_content=home&amp;utm_medium=RSS&amp;utm_source=NSNS</guid>
