    <item>
      <title>将宇宙视为一面向我们展示自己的镜子的危险</title>
      <link>https://www.newscientist.com/article/2586903-the-danger-of-viewing-the-cosmos-as-a-mirror-that-shows-us-ourselves/?utm_campaign=RSS|NSNS&amp;utm_content=home&amp;utm_medium=RSS&amp;utm_source=NSNS</link>
      <description><![CDATA[通过人类的视角来看待世界，甚至整个宇宙是很自然的——毕竟我们是人类。但专栏作家昌达·普雷斯科德-韦恩斯坦表示，我们可以欣赏宇宙的奇迹，而无需将自己作为主角]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.newscientist.com/article/2586903-the-danger-of-viewing-the-cosmos-as-a-mirror-that-shows-us-ourselves/?utm_campaign=RSS|NSNS&amp;utm_content=home&amp;utm_medium=RSS&amp;utm_source=NSNS</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 08 Sep 2026 08:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
