      <title>超级厄尔尼诺现象将导致亚马逊地区“极其危险”的干旱</title>
      <link>https://www.newscientist.com/article/2587998-super-el-nino-set-to-cause-terribly-dangerous-amazon-drought/?utm_campaign=RSS|NSNS&amp;utm_content=home&amp;utm_medium=RSS&amp;utm_source=NSNS</link>
